# How to use __NAME__

__NAME__ counts how often each activity occurs in your event log and in how many cases.

## When to use it

- You want a quick overview of which activities happen most often.
- TODO: name a situation where another module is the better tool.

## Before you start

- A case-centric event log with `case_id`, `activity` and `timestamp` columns.
- At least one event in one case.

## Settings

This module has no settings.

## Reading the results

### Activity summary

One row per activity with the number of events and the number of distinct cases it appears in, most frequent first.

